{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Marionette": 11,
    "Paimon": 10
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7470101",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the aquarium on the lower level",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "747010101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "747010101": {
            "id": "747010101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Why does Paimon feel like there's an extra pool here all of a sudden? What does that sign say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010102"
            ]
          },
          "747010102": {
            "id": "747010102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Danger — Keep Away!\" What does that mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010103"
            ]
          },
          "747010103": {
            "id": "747010103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "It means exactly what it says.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010104"
            ]
          },
          "747010104": {
            "id": "747010104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wah! Sandrone... You made Paimon jump! Did you put this sign here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010105"
            ]
          },
          "747010105": {
            "id": "747010105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Yes. With the intention of keeping any curious cats well away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010106"
            ]
          },
          "747010106": {
            "id": "747010106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's so special about this pool?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010107"
            ]
          },
          "747010107": {
            "id": "747010107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "It's full of piranhas.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010108"
            ]
          },
          "747010108": {
            "id": "747010108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wha—!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010109"
            ]
          },
          "747010109": {
            "id": "747010109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Haha, just kidding. Don't tell me you actually believed that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010110"
            ]
          },
          "747010110": {
            "id": "747010110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I learned that a few fish in the aquarium are highly territorial and can get rather aggressive. So, I moved them here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010111"
            ]
          },
          "747010111": {
            "id": "747010111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't scare Paimon like that! So, this place is like a special quarantine zone for aggro fishies?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010112"
            ]
          },
          "747010112": {
            "id": "747010112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Exactly, the water in this pool is much deeper, and there's a lot more space. It helps calm down the more territorial fish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010113"
            ]
          },
          "747010113": {
            "id": "747010113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I also asked Sigewinne at the Fortress of Meropide for some special bait to help mellow them out a bit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010114"
            ]
          },
          "747010114": {
            "id": "747010114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, wow... So, you really do care about the fishies' well-being!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010115"
            ]
          },
          "747010115": {
            "id": "747010115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I don't think anyone wants to see the aquarium turn into a blood bath.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010116"
            ]
          },
          "747010116": {
            "id": "747010116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's for sure! Anyway, why don't you leave this to us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010117"
            ]
          },
          "747010117": {
            "id": "747010117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "If you insist. When the fish in the pool feel comfortable enough to swim to the surface, it means they're on the mend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010118"
            ]
          },
          "747010118": {
            "id": "747010118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So once they're all relaxed and happy, we can put them back in the aquarium?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010119"
            ]
          },
          "747010119": {
            "id": "747010119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Where you put them is up to you. All I'm responsible for is scooping up the unruly ones and moving them here in the first place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010120"
            ]
          },
          "747010120": {
            "id": "747010120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Understood! But that sign is way too scary. Maybe we can change it for something a little less... terrifying?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "747010121"
            ]
          },
          "747010121": {
            "id": "747010121",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hmm... If you want. They're your fish, so I'll leave it up to you."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}